title: debug_conditional_options_start
tags: 
---
You encounter a locked container. Your options depend on your abilities and inventory. #line:debug_conditional_options_start_00
-> Force it Open (Costs Hull) #line:debug_conditional_options_start_01
    <<damage_ship 10>>
    <<jump debug_conditional_options_opened>>
-> Use Keycard <<if (has_item("resource_palladium", 1)) and (has_item("resource_palladium", 1))>> #line:debug_conditional_options_start_02
    <<take_item resource_palladium 1>>
    <<jump debug_conditional_options_opened>>
<<if $has_hacking>>
    -> Hack (Requires Skill) #line:debug_conditional_options_start_03
        <<jump debug_conditional_options_opened>>
<<endif>>
-> Leave #line:debug_conditional_options_start_04 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: debug_conditional_options_opened
tags: 
